# 统一换行符，避免 Windows/Linux 之间产生无意义 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows PowerShell 脚本保持 CRLF（并且文件内已带 UTF-8 BOM）
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# 二进制资源
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
*.zip binary

# 语言统计
docs/** linguist-documentation
